# These scripts are downloaded raw (curl/irm from raw.githubusercontent.com)
# and executed as-is, so the committed bytes must have the line endings the
# interpreter needs, regardless of each contributor's core.autocrlf:
# - sh needs LF (a CR breaks `set -eu` and the shebang)
# - cmd.exe batch files need CRLF (LF-only files can break `goto`/labels)
*.sh   text eol=lf
*.cmd  text eol=crlf
*.ps1  text eol=crlf
*.vbs  text eol=crlf
